      "@id": "urn:fairos:20260423074546-6261--20260423074549-339-001-1",
      "@type": "https://w3id.org/ftr#TestResult",
      "description": "The test assesses whether the provided URL includes a unique or persistent identifier, using a tool called [IDUTILS](https://pypi.org/project/idutils/) to detect known identifier schemes. \n    The system successfully identifies two types of unique identifier schemes present: a DOI (Digital Object Identifier) or a URL.\n    \n    Source: Since FAIROS uses [F-UJI](https://f-uji.net) to assess a Research Object, this test is an instance of the test **FsF-F1-01MD-1**. You can find more information in the european project FAIR IMPACT(https://fair-impact.eu/metrics-data)",
      "identifier": {
        "@id": "urn:fairos:20260423074546-6261--20260423074549-339-001-1"
      },
      "assessmentTarget": {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/ro-id/13dfbe3b-3132-4089-9ec9-5ae100fb143c/resources/9df1815f-3b8e-444f-b07f-e667c60b95d0"
